docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-22-revision-program-design.md:490:### 8.2 Cost
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-22-revision-program-design.md:492:Unit: one headline D2+H3 cell (search, bank, reference, 40-seed evaluation) at the registered budget, about 25
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-22-revision-program-design.md:494:multiplier 2.5 (double evaluations, about 770 corner-control vectors; the build records the exact count for 15 knobs); a doubling check 1 unit (X7-SC 2.5); inner tuning
