docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-22-revision-program-design.md:503:| Coverage (9.5): 8 profiles x 20,000 seeds x 3 markets = 480,000 episodes (26.9) + bootstrap computation (about 3 core-hours, 10) | 36.9 |
