docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-22-revision-program-design.md:521:- **Development cap 12 USD.** If the recomputed development cost exceeds it: (1) the comparator selection and tuning use
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-22-revision-program-design.md:522:  the headline market and `dev0` only, and the coverage fixtures use the replacement design of 9.5; (2) the coverage pools
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-22-revision-program-design.md:523:  shrink to 10,000 seeds per market. If it still exceeds the cap, work stops and the author decides.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-22-revision-program-design.md:524:- **Evaluation cap 40 USD.** If the recomputed evaluation cost exceeds it, cuts apply in this order before the lock: (1)
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-22-revision-program-design.md:525:  whole-system cells on fresh markets (keep headline); (2) H4 on fresh markets (Q3's independently authored part is then
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-22-revision-program-design.md:526:  headline only, stated in the protocol, 8.1a); (3) D2 matched extras on fresh markets; (4) C*/S0 cells on fresh markets.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-22-revision-program-design.md:537:distribution of that market, conditional on the frozen searches. Contrasts between rules use per-seed differences on
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-22-revision-program-design.md:538:common seeds (the same seeds, salt, and job values for every rule in a market).
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-22-revision-program-design.md:556:- **Pooled mean over the six fresh markets.** The equal-weight mean of the market means; stratified bootstrap (seeds
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-22-revision-program-design.md:557:  resampled independently within each market, since seed streams are independent across markets), studentized by the
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-22-revision-program-design.md:558:  stratified standard error; conditional on the six markets.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-22-revision-program-design.md:571:- **Q1, confirmatory on the pooled fresh markets.** Family of 2 tests: F111 vs C*, families D2+H3 and X7-SC, each on
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-22-revision-program-design.md:572:  the pooled mean d = g_C* - g_F111 of the per-seed differences over the six fresh markets. Statistical direction and
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-22-revision-program-design.md:576:  1. **materially lower**: I lies entirely above 0.05 ("R3 materially lower gain") or entirely below -0.05 ("C*
