docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-22-revision-program-design.md:649:  in the order of their derivation index; stratum s of a market takes the s-th consecutive block of floor(M / k) seeds,
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-22-revision-program-design.md:650:  where M is the market's pool size and k the number of strata per market; the remainder is discarded for Q1 only. Q1
